From aaa0e3cb578b038bbcadf23acd07ae1ec2eead5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: florent pirou <florent.pirou@intel.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 02:49:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 58/80] d4xx-max96724: drop max96712 legacy-mode, set and reset
 src-link pipe aggregation

* d4xx-max96724: control pipe set and reset per deser link source
* d4xx-max96724: enable csi output right after set pipes
* d4xx-max96724: disable max96712 legacy-mode compile option
* d4xx-max96724: reduce i2c channel-control scope, add src-link pipe aggregation

Signed-off-by: florent pirou <florent.pirou@intel.com>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/d4xx-compat/d4xx-max96724.c | 247 ++++++++++++------
 drivers/media/i2c/d4xx-compat/d4xx.c          |  44 ++--
 include/media/i2c/d4xx-max96724.h             |   8 +-
 3 files changed, 197 insertions(+), 102 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/d4xx-compat/d4xx-max96724.c b/drivers/media/i2c/d4xx-compat/d4xx-max96724.c
index 45b5de4e..382beee0 100644
